          "location": "Dover, DE",
          "period": "Aug 2016–Jul 2019",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<ul><li>Built and administered an HPC research cluster with 8 compute nodes, 320 CPUs, and 512 GB RAM for nano-bio spectroscopy simulations and data-intensive experiments</li><li>Completed ML projects in pattern recognition and dimensionality reduction (PCA, LDA, LLE), and investigated visible-light access control for wireless insulin-pump security</li></ul>",
          "roles": []
        },
        {
