          "description": "<ul><li>Developed BP neural-network and decision-tree models for natural-gas pipeline energy forecasting, achieving approximately 90% accuracy for strategic planning analyses</li><li>Built an M/M/C vehicle-allocation model and delivered analytics and enterprise software using MATLAB, Java, SQL, Weka, and statistical modeling</li></ul>",
